between I2S, DMIC, SFC, MVC, AMX, ADX, MIXER, OPE, and the AHUB)
describe the SoC's internal audio routing fabric, not board-specific
wiring. Move them from tegra210-p2371-2180.dts into tegra210.dtsi so
