+ * - NETFS_CACHE_COLLECT_WRITE_DATA for a contiguous block of data
+ * - NETFS_CACHE_COLLECT_WRITE_GAP if a discontiguity was skipped
+ * - NETFS_CACHE_COLLECT_WRITE_CANCEL for a hole due to a failed/cancelled write
